      "category": "overview",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "Complete your education and build career-ready skills with one of ASU's most flexible degrees. This career-focused program maximizes credits you've earned, minimizes credit loss and tailors coursework to your goals, putting you on track for a meaningful profession that fulfills your passion.",
